    'What is the RSV vaccine, and how well does it work?',
    'The vaccine currently used is Abrysvo, which covers both RSV subtypes A and B. In a study of more than 34,000 adults aged 60 and over, the vaccine reduced the risk of RSV lower respiratory tract disease by 67% compared with those who were not vaccinated.',
